- Fix site: `src/fares.ts:10`, change `if (rider.age > 65)` to `if (rider.age >= 65)`. Constants (`BASE_FARE_CENTS`, `CONCESSION_FARE_CENTS`) and all other branches are unaffected and reused as-is.
- Test gap to close (in `test/fares.test.ts`, not edited by me): add assertions for age 65 → 175 and age 64 → 350, alongside the existing age 8/30/70 cases, so the boundary itself is covered going forward.
